# Change quality gate

Before finishing any feature change:

- No `apiJson`/`useQuery`/`useMutation` import in a `views/*.view.tsx` file.
- No business logic (validation beyond simple required-field checks, data transformation, API calls) in a
  `src/app/**/page.tsx` route file.
- Every new use case is one file, one repository call.
- `npm run lint` and `npx tsc --noEmit` both pass.
